              "type": 10,
              "content": "Hey everyone,\nWe’ve just pushed a major update to the server and our bot. Here’s everything you need to know:\n🤖 Bot Update\nNew & improved commands\nFaster response times\nBetter logging and moderation tools\nFixed several bugs reported by staff\nOnline 24/7\n\n🔄 Discord Overhaul\nThe entire server has been reorganized for better structure and easier navigation.\n\nChannels, categories, and voice channels have been cleaned up and themed around Laredo.\n🎭 New Roles\nWe’ve added new roles to better organize the community and staff:\n\nUpdated department roles\nNew staff ranking roles\nSpecial access roles for scenes & sessions\n\n🔐 Permissions Update\nPermissions have been completely reworked:\n\nClearer access for each department\nBetter separation between staff, members, and visitors\nImproved security on staff & development channels\nScene and RF channels now have proper access control\n\nPlease re-check your roles and make sure everything looks correct.\n\nIf you’re missing a role or can’t access something you should be able to, open a ticket.\nThanks for your patience while we made these changes.\n\nEnjoy the new layout and updated bot!\n— Management Team"
